http://tintsandshades.nijin.site/*   /tints-and-shades/:splat  200

# Edge redirects for migrated landing, privacy, and terms pages
/design-system-extractor/privacy.html  /docs/design-system-extractor/privacy  301
/design-system-extractor/terms.html    /docs/design-system-extractor/terms    301
/design-system-extractor               /docs/design-system-extractor          301
/design-system-extractor/              /docs/design-system-extractor          301

/tasks/privacy.html                    /docs/tasks-extension/privacy          301
/tasks/terms.html                      /docs/tasks-extension/terms            301
/tasks                                 /docs/tasks-extension                  301
/tasks/                                /docs/tasks-extension                  301

/tints-and-shades/privacy.html         /docs/tints-and-shades/privacy         301
